  "body": "There are various places in the input spec where behaviors are dependent on if the user can physically-modify the text representation of the input. These fields are referred to as \"text fields\", which is somewhat confusing since there is an actual `input type=text`.\n\nI'd like to propose reframing this as \"textual input fields\" to add more mental distance between the two concepts.\n",
